@baseUrl = http://localhost:9377
@accessToken = {{socialLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@petId = {{createPet.response.body.$.data.petId}}

### 0. 소셜 로그인 (토큰 확보)
# @name socialLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "GOOGLE",
  "providerUserId": "google-pet-test-001",
  "email": "pet.test@example.com",
  "name": "펫테스트"
}

### 1. 반려동물 등록
# @name createPet
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "초코",
  "species": "DOG",
  "breed": "푸들",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "isNeutered": true,
  "birthday": "2020-05-01T00:00:00",
  "bio": "산책 좋아함"
}

### 2. 내 반려동물 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. 반려동물 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pets/{{petId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "초코수정",
  "bio": "간식도 좋아함",
  "isNeutered": false
}

### 4. 프로필 이미지 연결 (fileId는 file.http 업로드 후 교체)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pets/{{petId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profileFileId": 1
}

### 5. 프로필 이미지 제거
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pets/{{petId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "removeProfileFile": true
}

### 6. 태그 승인 (feedPetId는 피드 태그 생성 후)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pets/tags/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. 태그 거절
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pets/tags/1/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. 반려동물 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pets/{{petId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. 삭제 후 목록 (없어야 함)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
